Date: Thu, 22 Aug 2019 13:39:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 035/178] arm64: dts: xiaomi: Overlayed dtsi for lavender tulip
 wayne and whyred

* Squash of the initial commit:
  bcdf37ba9d7c6f7901caf8125c19d28cb5525ebd dts: Overlayed dtsi for tulip wayne and whyred

  with the addition of:
  97c707559da11197708230e8a7590272a61c38ef dts: xiaomi: Fix mdss_dsi0 and mdss_dsi1 edits
  dc99fb415fa1348e6df5adbd6f1ecafe4716a3a3 dts: xiaomi: Fix dai_mi2s0 dts edit
  29febe55a3036824ca1c02207faed66ee0936c2f dts: xiaomi: Update some comments
  cfacb57b841b579a486a5a52a360e032c3031e65 dts: xiaomi: Add jasmine dts
  320b4903263406f866217ab6b773cb7554efe39d dts: xiaomi: Delete qcom,dsi-pref-prim-pan for mdss_dsi1

dts: Differentiate as per device
dts: qcom: Rework xiaomi dts inclusion
dts: xiaomi: tulip: Don't include sdm636-camera-sensor-mtp twice
dts: xiaomi: initial longcheer move
dts: longcheer: Remove common fg-recharge-voltage

Change-Id: Ia2a3f57ec1cb7effde279b294d849ca2faf6c103
